## 7. Conclusion

Open-Source Software Engineering encourages collaboration and knowledge sharing among developers. By contributing documentation to the Library Management System, students can improve the usability of the software and gain practical experience in collaborative development. GitHub features such as Fork, Commit and Pull Request make the contribution process simple and effective.
